OL,3,AAlmost 1,000 arrested in protests
OL,4,Aacross France, minister says, as
OL,5,Aclashes erupt
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlmost 1,000 people have been arrested
OL,8,Fduring protests across France, the
OL,9,Finterior minister says, as clashes
OL,10,Ferupt after a day of mostly peaceful
OL,11,Fdemonstrations
OL,13,FIn Porte de Vincennes, Paris,
OL,14,Fprotesters threw objects towards the
OL,15,Fpolice, while barricades were set
OL,16,Falight in Marseille and people ripped
OL,17,Fboards from a shop in Bordeaux
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
