OL,3,AAlmost 1,000 arrested in protests
OL,4,Aacross France, minister says, as
OL,5,Aclashes erupt
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice fired tear gas in cities
OL,8,Fincluding Lyon and Nantes as hundreds
OL,9,Fof thousands took to the streets across
OL,10,FFrance - 110,000 protesters marched in
OL,11,FParis alone, police say
OL,13,FToday's marches follow last weekend's
OL,14,Friots and looting that saw more than
OL,15,F2,700 arrested across France - why are
OL,16,Fpeople protesting?
OL,18,FElsewhere in Europe, protests have also
OL,19,Fbeen taking place today in Brussels,
OL,20,FRome and Milan
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
